{"id":"eef26246e5f57d8e","group":"68","path":"68/68-prop-finite-extension-undecidability.md","title":"Undecidability Descends from Finite Extensions","display":"prop-finite-extension-undecidability — Undecidability Descends from Finite Extensions","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-prop-finite-extension-undecidability","aliases":["68-prop-finite-extension-undecidability"],"display":"prop-finite-extension-undecidability — Undecidability Descends from Finite Extensions","depends_on":["[[68-df-first-order-syntax]]","[[68-df-theory-decidability]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§11 Proposition 11.1 p.34 / PDF 43","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-proof-and-coding-reduction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-prop-finite-extension-undecidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-prop-finite-extension-undecidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-finite-extension-undecidability — Undecidability Descends from Finite Extensions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dddcd7f37b01bd\" href=\"?note=83dddcd7f37b01bd\" title=\"68-df-first-order-syntax\">68-df-first-order-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11bfe06b58ad0c0f\" href=\"?note=11bfe06b58ad0c0f\" title=\"68-df-theory-decidability\">68-df-theory-decidability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11 Proposition 11.1 p.34 / PDF 43"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-and-coding-reduction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;=T\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\gamma)\">\\(T&#39;=T\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\gamma)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conj}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Conj}_{68}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{68}\">\\(b_{68}\\)</span> 与句子编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83dddcd7f37b01bd\" href=\"?note=83dddcd7f37b01bd\" title=\"68-df-first-order-syntax\">68-df-first-order-syntax</a>；后承、有限扩张及可判定性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11bfe06b58ad0c0f\" href=\"?note=11bfe06b58ad0c0f\" title=\"68-df-theory-decidability\">68-df-theory-decidability</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinExt}_{68}(\\sigma,T,T&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FinExt}_{68}(\\sigma,T,T&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T&#39;,p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T,b_{68}(7,\\operatorname{Conj}_{68}(\\gamma),p))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T&#39;,p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T,b_{68}(7,\\operatorname{Conj}_{68}(\\gamma),p))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T&#39;)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T&#39;)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Proposition 11.1，印刷 p.34 / PDF p.43；已渲染该页并核对原书证明。原书 ψ 为新增公理的合取，φ 为查询句子；这里 ψ=Conj(γ)，φ=p。每个 T 模型若满足全部新增公理，则满足 p，恰好等价于该模型满足 ψ→p。若 T 的后承可判定，先判断合法句子码，再把 p 映到 b_68(7,Conj(γ),p)，即可判定 T′。该映射的 sc 表达是固定素数的幂乘积，所以是全递归的；句法检查由上游码的有限分析给出。γ=() 时 Conj 是恒真闭句，包含零新增公理的边界。此为语义证明与显式编码归约核对，无机器形式证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"83dddcd7f37b01bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-theory-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"11bfe06b58ad0c0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-theory-decidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"83dddcd7f37b01bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)$，$\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)^{<\\omega}$，$T'=T\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\gamma)$。$\\operatorname{Conj}_{68}$、$b_{68}$ 与句子编码见 [[68-df-first-order-syntax]]；后承、有限扩张及可判定性见 [[68-df-theory-decidability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-theory-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"11bfe06b58ad0c0f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)$，$\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)^{<\\omega}$，$T'=T\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\gamma)$。$\\operatorname{Conj}_{68}$、$b_{68}$ 与句子编码见 [[68-df-first-order-syntax]]；后承、有限扩张及可判定性见 [[68-df-theory-decidability]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"T'=T\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conj}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"b_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FinExt}_{68}(\\sigma,T,T').","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T',p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T,b_{68}(7,\\operatorname{Conj}_{68}(\\gamma),p))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T')\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T).","display":true}],"bytes":2039,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-prop-finite-extension-undecidability]] — proposition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-prop-finite-extension-undecidability|prop-finite-extension-undecidability — Undecidability Descends from Finite Extensions]]"}],"outgoing":["83dddcd7f37b01bd","11bfe06b58ad0c0f"]}